<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS5" title="In Appendix C Extension to Experiments ‣ The Debate on RLVR Reasoning Capability Boundary: Shrinkage, Expansion, or Both? A Two-Stage Dynamic View" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.5 </span>Entropy Behavior Analysis from Different Levels</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS6" title="In Appendix C Extension to Experiments ‣ The Debate on RLVR Reasoning Capability Boundary: Shrinkage, Expansion, or Both? A Two-Stage Dynamic View" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.6 </span>Full Procedure for Case Study</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
