</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span>Comparison of the training dynamics of GRPO, GRPO-N on the MATH benchmark across training steps, using the <span id="A3.F4.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">LLama-3.2-3B-Instruct</span> model with a prompt batch size of 1,024. <span id="A3.F4.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Left Part:</span> (Left) the greedy decoding accuracy on the MATH test set and (Center Left) the model’s entropy on the MATH test set. <span id="A3.F4.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Right Part:</span> (Center Right) the actor entropy loss and (Right) critic rewards mean during training.</figcaption>
</figure>
